<Base idioma="en" caminho="en/privacy/" titulo="Privacy — Paulo Padilha" descricao="How this portfolio uses GitHub Pages, YouTube and external contact links. No analytics, advertising trackers or first-party cookies.">
  <article class="container text">
    <h1>Privacy</h1><p class="updated">Updated October 18, 2026.</p>
    <p>This is a static portfolio. It has no forms, accounts or database, and uses no first-party cookies, analytics or advertising trackers. Fonts and images are served by this website.</p>
    <h2>External services</h2>
    <h3>Hosting — GitHub Pages</h3><p>GitHub Pages hosts this website and receives technical information such as your IP address and browser, under the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h3>Videos — YouTube</h3><p>No YouTube player loads until you choose to play a video. Embedded videos use YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode at youtube-nocookie.com. Once a player loads, Google may collect information under its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privacy policy</a>. Privacy-enhanced mode reduces, but does not eliminate, this collection. You can also open the video directly on YouTube.</p>
    <h3>Contact — WhatsApp</h3><p>WhatsApp links open with a suggested message. You can edit it or choose not to send it. This website does not send messages. Conversations are subject to the <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h3>LinkedIn and Instagram</h3><p>These links only open the external profiles when you choose to follow them.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about this page, use the contact options on the portfolio.</p><a href={url('en/')}>Back to the portfolio</a>
  </article>
</Base>
